    dct:identifier "5b.3." ;
    skos:definition "A use case developed from AI Act Annex III point 5(b) in which the AI system involves purpose: establishing or assessing/evaluating creditworthiness; processing context: profiling, assessing or classifying natural persons, evaluation or scoring, legal effects / processing resulting in legal effects, financial data, credit score; technology: AI; AI or data subjects: vulnerable persons."@en ;
