annex3:C7c-3 a eu-aiact:HighRiskAISystem-AnnexIII-7-c ;
    dct:identifier "7c.3." ;
    skos:definition "A use case developed from AI Act Annex III point 7(c) in which the AI system involves purpose: examining asylum applications, visa and residence permits; technology: AI; special categories of personal data: health data, political opinions, sexual orientation, sensitive data; AI or data subjects: natural persons; deployer: public authorities / competent public authorities, public authority agent, Union agencies, Union offices, Union bodies."@en ;
