annex3:C7d a eu-aiact:HighRiskAISystem-AnnexIII-7-d ;
    dct:identifier "7d" ;
    skos:definition "7. Migration, asylum and border control management, insofar as their use is permitted under relevant Union or national law:(d) AI systems intended to be used by or on behalf of competent public authorities, including Union agencies, offices or bodies, in the context of migration, asylum and border control management, for the purpose of detecting, recognising or identifying natural persons with the exception of verification of travel documents."@en ;
