    dct:identifier "7d.1." ;
    skos:definition "A use case developed from AI Act Annex III point 7(d) in which the AI system involves purpose: detecting, recognising or identifying natural persons; processing context: profiling; technology: AI; special categories of personal data: biometrics* / biometric data; AI or data subjects: natural persons; deployer: public authorities / competent public authorities, public authority agent, Union agencies, Union offices, Union bodies."@en ;
