    skos:note "DPIA required by member states: SE, AT, CY, IE, IT LV, MT SI (Asylum seekers) AT CZ DK DE GR (Use of AI in processing) AT BE BG HR CZ DK EE FR DE GR HU IS IE LV LI LT LU MT NL NO PL PT SK SI ES (Biometrics)"@en ;
